37936>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
37936>>>                Case Break
37937>>>
37937>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37937>>>
37937>>>        Case End
37937>>>
37937>>>        Send SetActionButtons
37938>>>
37938>>>    End_Procedure
37939>>>
37939>>>End_Object 
